  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shandong Minhe Poultry Manure Biogas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to mitigate Green House Gas (GHG) emissions and purchase the reductions from chicken manure by improving waste management practices at the Shandong Minhe Company&apos;s chicken farms; and to utilize biogas in a co-generation system to supply electricity/and or displace electricity from grid-based conventional energy sources.</narrative>
  </description>
